  Label: bottom-left absolute, text-xs text-zinc-400
  Wrapper: aspect-video rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-950 overflow-hidden relative

ArenaControls.jsx:
  Props: { onMute, onVideoToggle, onEndSession, isMuted, isVideoOff }
  Floating pill dock fixed bottom center
  Mic icon: red background when muted
  Camera icon: red background when video off
  End Session: bg-red-600, always requires window.confirm before firing

SimulationArena.jsx:
  Guard: useEffect → if no agentEmbedUrl → navigate('/')
  Left 50%: user webcam via getUserMedia, video element mirrored
  Right 50%: AvatarView with agentEmbedUrl from context
  Bottom: transcript textarea + ArenaControls
  Transcript textarea: bg-zinc-900/80 border border-zinc-700 rounded-lg
    p-3 text-zinc-300 text-sm w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto resize-none rows=3
    placeholder="Summarise what you presented... (used for your debrief score)"
  sessionStartTime: useRef(Date.now()) set on mount
  On end session: call endSession with transcript + duration, navigate /debrief

ContextUpload.jsx:
  After processDocument() success: save ALL 6 prompt fields to context
  After startSession() success: save agentId, agentEmbedUrl, agentName to context
  Loading overlay: full screen bg-black/90 with sequential messages:
    "> Reading your document..."            (1500ms)
    "> GPT-4o identifying weak arguments..."(1500ms)
    "> Generating panel member persona..."  (1500ms)
    "> Initializing your defense panel..."  (1500ms)
    "> The panel is ready. Good luck."      (1500ms then navigate /arena)
  Use chained setTimeout, not setInterval

Dropzone.jsx:
  Accept PDF only
  Pass raw File object to onFileAccepted(file)
  States: idle / drag-over (border-blue-500) / success (show filename)
  Validate: file.type === "application/pdf" before accepting

