# ── DEMO SCRIPT (memorize this) ─────────────────────────────

The 5-minute pitch ends with exactly 1 minute of live demo.

1. Have the AirTrixx PDF pre-loaded and ready
2. Open http://localhost:5173 (or live Vercel URL)
3. Click "Startup Pitch"
4. Drop the PDF into the dropzone
5. Show the 5 loading messages appearing
6. Arena opens — avatar iframe visible on right
7. Say: "AirTrixx is a gesture-based laptop control system.
         Our budget is 50,850 LKR and we believe the market is huge."
8. Avatar interrupts: challenges the budget or market claim specifically
9. Crowd reacts. Demo ends. You win.

FALLBACK: If live demo fails, play the pre-recorded 2-minute video immediately.
Never stand at a broken screen. Cut to video without apologizing.

# ── WHAT TO NEVER TOUCH ──────────────────────────────────────

Do NOT attempt these — they will waste time and break things:
  - Beyond Presence knowledge base PDF upload (no public API)
  - Two simultaneous avatar agents (session length + bandwidth issues)
  - Beyond Presence Calls API transcript fetching (undocumented)
  - Authentication or user login flow
  - Mobile responsive layout
  - Redux or Zustand
  - Any database beyond pitch_sessions table

